      "rkaf:appliesInJurisdiction": [],
      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, on or about an individual's person or accessible property when: (1) performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; (2) entering or in a sterile area; or (3) attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23."
    },
