      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:06d14f32282e15093257b404cd12d9466e95bd18b8be375bf497c7523c6131be\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:91457922e2f81e63c979a1e9458835a89c5c1fd13915a37d610b1cd7f3fd8cb9\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c5f6f4ec7ae8440c7a09103f72f558f789625940e696fe45a8c5cfacafe5a956\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:472a1d97dcf4734df8697d05fb9cf6eb72ede502a710e4fb189194e5b70df800\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e8e380f2c97e88ad7f169e8331b6ca1f070e943f43eceb7601bb4d3a1f27f1f1\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:73e43e161a820d813e7a079a10943a2a3080f082fd0fd01662f02c9a1a0482a6\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a91b4cdb46591f82ce05cf93276933240a343b2991b5c62685ee1e057ac42bbf\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:47d56dfda30d7d3afb50b30219704c1abeff00c94621d110987500a772a44fe1\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5884f6cfb454bd8278178ad375f28087c3286ea2ceb6e1e26a41672191eb78bb\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"choice_text\":\"One or more of the following circumstances: (1) when performance has begun of the inspection before entering a sterile area or boarding a screened aircraft under this subchapter; (2) when entering or in a sterile area; or (3) when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft screened under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":769,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":226,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:219:226:sha256-0007a8bea4dcd3f6b1490fc7199650f1046713dd92d9314e1f2ede6946fcd999\",\"quote\":\"may not\",\"start\":219},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:769:sha256-22dcfb8db4667ffae9d7a7b17b48ca968730412e4f33fe6a7d2d7577439d118b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":327,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:327:sha256-a32c8dfb7196d8707007190b60d5fd2a41cfc2faf3efbb1eecb19d61e6401457\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":546,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:546:sha256-d5fe1a750d86ba4e476f3b755b0d6c324a6a6e30d69b292a6b13efb667ae044b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":608,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:548:608:sha256-c139a639c1d605a7d307ad6a66eb81168e6c66c3a021b60c289053565aaa41c2\",\"quote\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"start\":548},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:610:769:sha256-3303604764789bed72f78d4739f5fe14e317e2fcc6c61bed6be2c6efd864dead\",\"quote\":\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":610}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:a5bb22ccafc93ed12815c5b72b8cc8e63d998dc32b3b160ee114c25636518e2b\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5884f6cfb454bd8278178ad375f28087c3286ea2ceb6e1e26a41672191eb78bb\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:7aefc7ccdf25bc8612c92fdff13eed2fc25192af083a4dc4b65ca14196819f3d\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (b)\",\"§ 1544.201\",\"§ 1546.201\",\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:790fe76d9dfede40f0a69af75ab99d6664f7544ed4e4a8caf6857537fb9d9679\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\"],\"scope_text\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, on or about an individual's person or accessible property when: (1) performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; (2) entering or in a sterile area; or (3) attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":85,\"summary\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary on or about the individual's person or accessible property when inspection has begun before entering a sterile area or boarding an aircraft screened under this subchapter, when entering or in a sterile area, or when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft screened under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
